    17	    The Scope block extends from the `Scope` header line to the first
    18	    top-level continuation header (Effective:, Plans:, Rationale,
    19	    Authorization source:, Anchor commit:, a re-encountered
    20	    `Approved-By:`) or markdown horizontal rule (---, ***, ___) or
    21	    end-of-text. Sub-headers within Scope (lines ending with `:` that
    22	    are NOT in the terminator set) are silently skipped.
    23	    """
